UxQOUdrOGtYaXlLaFdueF94S3hPajVGQnFZbXk2NWxVSXlVUnJqczZCaGxGcDJWd05hUVRHY0p2QkFSemR4WVVRMmRSYTlZdDRLUGZwZlZwMk5WX1JrZXVLWWtReG0zb3dldlRqbF92N05GSkstS1ZVT1ZMU1pFTDlKd0Fac285N0tZN0NZbHp0OE9yWVRuMVUxVWtXUWZzMm81blZmd0VJTTFfTTZxMFpKdg?oc=5","date":"2026-10-15","zh":"CAVA 集團 2026 財年第 3 季業績：預定 11 月 4 日召開收益電話會議"},{"title":"CAVA Group (CAVA) Targets 1,000 Locations By 2032","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPYXktdFBFVW8zT1lxbmVxaVgyRi0wREtBVFlZRFk0eFVkV1BYMGxxZVQzMmdwWkNaSzNfVGlqRUdXUS1LaXkzUFNBVmhaR2hIcjhadTFnTTB2ZFBfQ3RVLXdPMTNteVJ2NU1nNzdYRk9TLUJBOWRVN1JLMzlzdjUzUW9FYjhYTFhxRkROYUpGWXlxVUQ2?oc=5","date":"2026-10-14","zh":"CAVA 集團 (CAVA) 的目標是到 2032 年開設 1,000 家門市"},{"title":"Guggenheim maintains Buy on Cava, lowers price target to $95","src":"scanx.trade","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQZG9XLWRLRkxuVGktTzZ5ZXV0R2hhbVMweERDcEJaTlZkUE5uSTVaaEI2N3p4R28tMVVMRnhiRWRaMzRDbXoxdjUtOHFoSzR2TVcta3Uxek1MVWtXQ29DeHI5d1F6aFdYc2FhQmJiTk8tQXNSRnNwUXdGeXg1SmRMUHppamdsUTJEREdWaHNycndCTTVUZDRTLWR2NmtoMHlzOHJ6QWRudjR3SGlxNzFRTXdwUDR6b00?oc=5","date":"2026-10-14","zh":"古根漢維持對 Cava 的買入評級，將目標價下調至 95 美元"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-28","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1639438/000162828026011296/cava-20251228.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"CAVA Group, Inc. (together with its wholly owned subsidiaries, referred to as the \"Company,\" \"CAVA,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" and \"our,\" unless specified otherwise) was formed as a Delaware corporation in 2015, and prior to that, the first CAVA restaurant opened in 2011 in Bethesda, Maryland. As of December 28, 2025, we operate 439 fast-casual CAVA Restaurants in 28 states and Washington, D.C. The Company's authentic Mediterranean cuisine unites taste and health, with a menu that features chef-curated and customizable bowls and pitas. We centrally produce our dips, spreads, and certain dressing bases for use in our restaurants while also selling our dips, spreads, and prepared dressings in grocery stores.","zh":null},{"en":"We believe that our differentiated offerings and broad appeal give us significant opportunity in the Mediterranean and health and wellness food categories. Our guests span age groups, genders, and income brackets with a strong Millennial and a growing Gen Z contingent. The broad appeal of our brand is evidenced by substantial diversity across geographies, formats, dayparts, and channels. We are in the early stages of fulfilling our total restaurant potential, and we believe there is opportunity for more than 1,000 CAVA restaurants in the United States by 2032. We believe we are well positioned to benefit from the following strong and emerging trends:","zh":null},{"en":"Our menu fulfills a broad range of dietary preferences, from hearty and indulgent to vegan, vegetarian, gluten-free, dairy-free, paleo, keto, and nut-free diets. We have designed our menu to offer vibrant flavors using many fresh, high-","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The restaurant industry is highly competitive with respect to, among other things, food quality and presentation, taste preferences, price, brand reputation, digital engagement, service, value, and location. The food manufacturing industry is also highly competitive with respect to, among other things, food quality, taste, functional benefits, nutritional value and ingredients, convenience, brand loyalty and positioning, food variety, product packaging, shelf space, price, and promotional activities. We face significant competition from national, regional, and locally-owned restaurants, including limited service restaurants, particularly within the fast-casual dining and traditional fast-food categories, which offer in-restaurant, carry-out, delivery, and/or catering services. We also compete with grocery stores, meal subscription services, and delivery kitchens, especially those that ta","zh":null},{"en":"As we expand our geographic presence and develop our digital channels, we anticipate we will face increased competition for channel access. In addition, our competitors will likely grow in number as the Mediterranean food category grows, and we may face the risk that new or existing competitors will mimic our business model, menu offerings, marketing strategies, and overall concept. See Item 1A. \"Risk Factors—Risks Related to Our Business and Our Industry—We operate in a highly competitive industry\" for more information.","zh":null}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-28","items":[{"name":"Restaurant Revenue","val":1169286000,"zh":"Restaurant Revenue"},{"name":"CPG Revenue & Other","val":10378000,"zh":"CPG Revenue & Other"}],"total":1179664000}},"peers":["SG","BROS","RDDT","CELH","TOST"]}}